{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>新加坡2026年6月19日 /美通社/ -- 憑借真摯本色、出眾才華與獨特個人風格而深受大眾喜愛的金裕貞，正式加入不斷壯大的CHARLES &amp; KEITH家族，擔任品牌代言人。</p>\n<p>她所展現的現代女性氣質、創造力與自信，與CHARLES &amp; KEITH倡導的品牌精神高度契合，生動詮釋了品牌一直以來對鼓勵個性表達、崇尚真我風格與當代時尚的執著追求。</p>\n<p>在未來的廣告宣傳和品牌活動中，金裕貞將與CHARLES &amp; KEITH攜手，共同激勵全球消費者勇敢表達自我、彰顯個性魅力。</p>\n<img alt=\"The CHARLES &amp; KEITH Family Grows - A Warm Welcome to Kim You Jung\" src=\"https://mmx.prnewswire.com/media/MS1866710/9172a2df52eb4b88837f8cc78c44e270.jpg?id=OA2719165\" title=\"The CHARLES &amp; KEITH Family Grows - A Warm Welcome to Kim You Jung\">\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Cision\" src=\"https://edge.prnewswire.com/c/img/favicon.png?sn=XG84633&amp;sd=2026-06-19\" title=\"Cision\">\n</p>\n<p>SOURCE CHARLES &amp; KEITH</p>\n<img src=\"https://rt.prnewswire.com/rt.gif?NewsItemId=XG84633&amp;Transmission_Id=202606190030PR_NEWS_ASPR_____XG84633&amp;DateId=20260619\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-19T06:18:59.175974+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":3,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"}}